DESCRIPTION:Long before modern psychology\, the Buddhist tradition develop
 ed a training manual to help us understand and transform our own minds. Th
 is six-week course brings that manual to life\, illuminating the processes
  through which we experience the world.
URL:https://www.londonbuddhistcentre.com/whats-on/mind-in-harmony-may-2026
END:VEVENT
